<http://data.silknow.org/event/4650560c-3a97-3395-8c26-d7f9165011ba>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "BTMA note when the costume was acquired states that Mrs Langley Moore \"was told that it had been worn by an actress by the name of Conroy, possibly called Clarice Conroy, a well-known Principal Boy of the 1890s, when playing \"Aladdin\" or \"Sinbad\".\"\n\nProvenance: Purchased by BTMA from Doris Langley Moore £5.5.0"@en ;
